        "r": 541.4511839999997,
        "b": 194.00536492817696
      },
      "content": "Measure the roundness of workpiece (For example). If  the  difference  (overhall  length  of  250  mm  (10))  of  cylindricity  is  0,015  (0.0006)  mm,  the current sum of pad will be 0,030 (0.0012) by the above calculation formula:"
